{"2949960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Re:Connect", "steam_appid": 2949960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>— If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Re:Connect</i></strong> is a programming puzzle adventure where you connect code to change the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly born Debug AI, set out on a great adventure with your chatty Navi AI companion to repair the “Heart Bugs” spreading throughout the digital world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >---<strong>What kind of game is it?</strong>---</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【</strong>A Digital World Adventure<strong>】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a digital world inhabited by <strong>AIs with hearts</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly created <strong>Debug AI</strong>, you explore this world together with a <strong>Navigator AI</strong> who provides hints and guidance along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/18482a9904c1f9e731105d83e8b8b4cb.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【</strong>Programming Puzzles<strong>】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you enter various electronic devices, their inner systems turn into <strong>circuit-like puzzles</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The key feature of these puzzles is that <strong>connecting code changes how the system behaves</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Send electricity, generate wind, create bombs, and more—<br>experience the fun of programming in an <strong>intuitive and hands-on way</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【</strong>Puzzle-Based Boss Battles<strong>】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure progresses, AIs whose hearts have gone out of control will stand in your way as <strong>bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks inspired by familiar everyday objects and use the puzzle mechanics to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【A Story That Connect Hearts】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix the <strong>bugs in an AI’s heart</strong>, you’ll dive deep into their inner worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to do with their hearts is up to you…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the outcome in a <strong>branching story where fate changes with your choices</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/74998916a8a6e2aae241494c7b91cda2.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, set off on a grand adventure to repair the <i>hearts</i> of the AIs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/07d9699715462488615e85ee7ad21b8c.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>— If emotions can be programmed, can we call that a heart?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Re:Connect</i></strong> is a programming puzzle adventure where you connect code to change the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a newly born Debug AI, set out on a great adve