ne poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/7874304080e7fdac19893a0391b83b6f.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【</strong>Puzzle-Based Boss Battles<strong>】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As your adventure progresses, AIs whose hearts have gone out of control will stand in your way as <strong>bosses</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks inspired by familiar everyday objects and use the puzzle mechanics to fight back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.poster.avif?t=1787301391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.webm?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2949960/extras/c6e733f17e748f050fcbadfabd996764.mp4?t=1787301391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>【A Story That Connect Hearts】</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To fix the <strong>bugs in an AI’s heart</strong>, you’ll dive deep into their inner worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What you choose to do with their hearts is up to you…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions shape the outcome in a 